# Master Admin ShoutOuts — compliance logging & retention

Design notes only (not FloqAi help). Resume: `@master-shoutouts$`.

## Standards mapping

| Control set | FloqR implementation |
|---|---|
| SOC 2 CC6 / CC7 | `shoutoutComplianceLogs` + append-only `shoutoutAudit` on submit/pay/approve/reject/end/media_purged |
| ISO 27001 A.8.15 / A.5.28 / A.5.33 | Master-Admin-only read; no client delete of compliance rows; evidence searchable |
| NIST 800-53 AU-2 / AU-3 / AU-11 | Who / what / when / venue / outcome; 7-year metadata retention |
| GDPR storage limitation + accountability | Media deleted after **90 days**; metadata anonymized after **7 years**; legal hold supported |

**Not claimed:** forever compressed media archives as a SOC 2 / ISO requirement.

## Master Admin UI

Tab group **ShoutOuts**:

- **Completed log** — search venue name, ShoutOut content, date range (Firestore query + client filter; no external search engine in v1)
- **Retention** — shows 7y / 90d policy, last purge counts, backfill button

Entity → **All ShoutOut Queues** stays live pending ops.

## Collections

- `shoutoutComplianceLogs/{shoutoutId}` — upserted from `shoutouts` writes (Functions trigger)
- `shoutoutComplianceMeta/retention` — purge job stamps
- `shoutoutAudit/{id}` — create + limited read; no update/delete

## Retention

- Audit metadata: **7 years**, then anonymize text/uids
- Media: **90 days** after completed/approved event, then Storage delete + `mediaPurgeStatus: purged`
- Legal hold blocks purge/anonymize

## Patron track (separate)

Patron Completed: Re-Use, Archive (moves to patron Archive tab), Save as template only if `IsModifiable=1`. Not the Master Admin compliance store.
